Erratum: Beginning with Circular T 443, the published steering corrections were affected by a misprint. 
This issue concerns only the steering values displayed in Section 2 and does not affect TAI calculation nor the d values displayed in Section 3. 
The correct steering values can be found at https://webtai.bipm.org/ftp/pub/tai/other-products/ealtai/feal-ftai. 
                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                        
